# BE monorepo

- **Runtime:** `apps/api` (Nest), `apps/web` (Next)
- **Contract:** `packages/api` (`@repo/api`) — no DB dependency
- **Database:** `packages/database` (`@repo/database`) — Prisma only here
- Internal deps: `workspace:*`; no deep cross-package paths
- `packages/*` must not import from `apps/*`

